    <release version="2.0.0" date="2026-11-03">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/rmitchellscott/reManager/releases/tag/v2.0.0</url>
      <description>
        <p>reManager 2.0 is a full redesign, now on iPhone, iPad, and Android.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Discover mods by category, popularity, and developer, and search the whole catalog</li>
          <li>Star mods and follow developers</li>
          <li>Review installs, upgrades, and removals together, then apply once</li>
          <li>The System tab shows what needs attention, with the fix beside it</li>
          <li>Guided steps after a reMarkable OS update</li>
          <li>Store SSH keys in the app</li>
          <li>Jobs keep running in the background</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
